OL,3,GNEWSAThousands without electricity as
OL,4,AStorm Boelo hits
OL,5,
OL,6,FThousands of homes across the island of
OL,7,FIreland are without power as Storm
OL,8,FBoelo hits.
OL,10,FAn amber warning is in force across
OL,11,Fparts of County Antrim and County
OL,12,FLondonderry until 10:00 GMT on Sunday,
OL,13,Fwhile an orange wind warning ended in
OL,14,FCounty Donegal at 09:00 local time.
OL,16,FThe worst impacted areas in Northern
OL,17,FIreland include Springfield in County
OL,18,FFermanagh and Bushmills in County
OL,19,FAntrim, where more than 1,000 homes
OL,20,Fnear each village are without power.
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,413,410,260,120,0,100
