OL,3,GNEWSAThousands without electricity as
OL,4,AStorm Boelo hits
OL,5,
OL,6,FAmong the villages worst affected in
OL,7,Fthe Republic of Ireland is Milford in
OL,8,FCounty Donegal with more 1,600 homes
OL,9,Fwithout power and Aghagad in County
OL,10,FSligo with over 1,200 homes impacted.
